gcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"電視台對橫山由加里失蹤案的報導。（YouTube@日テレNEWS）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250619/1012413034292973568412098.jpeg/yFxv0ja2z0xreK6yQDQWQmGT6qTxZ0yFswNne7MDZ3s\"/><figcaption>電視台對橫山由加里失蹤案的報導。（YouTube@日テレNEWS）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"電視台對橫山由加里失蹤案的報導。（YouTube@日テレNEWS）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250619/1012413036281204736538024.jpeg/qDmZU70YjJ3_PcP4U-BlUVveIgerG10_kWCVd5FglXc\"/><figcaption>電視台對橫山由加里失蹤案的報導。（YouTube@日テレNEWS）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"電視台對橫山由加里失蹤案的報導。（YouTube@日テレNEWS）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250619/1012413038399459328205749.jpeg/EirBFYBzJ5_cdTWu3A5wu1ceMROn6T_eqeMv0qnjL9I\"/><figcaption>電視台對橫山由加里失蹤案的報導。（YouTube@日テレNEWS）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"電視台對橫山由加里失蹤案的報導。（YouTube@日テレNEWS）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250619/1012413040521908224937426.jpeg/IlBUSjmTjdH8eWtPJQYIGMwAnfvZGnJ6YLlAJWC5QCU\"/><figcaption>電視台對橫山由加里失蹤案的報導。（YouTube@日テレNEWS）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"電視台對橫山由加里失蹤案的報導。（YouTube@日テレNEWS）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250619/1012413031428132864726403.jpeg/6HpdtVQ5qMTDh_BfBh3aQiUlB69bOxUNqB3QZqgd0GY\"/><figcaption>電視台對橫山由加里失蹤案的報導。（YouTube@日テレNEWS）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"電視台對橫山由加里失蹤案的報導。（YouTube@日テレNEWS）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250619/1012413034402025472415876.jpeg/6JqBZ4nH0d1cIS2ZqVjHyJF44VRU2ql3FQgjmRUII5k\"/><figcaption>電視台對橫山由加里失蹤案的報導。（YouTube@日テレNEWS）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"電視台對橫山由加里失蹤案的報導。（YouTube@日テレNEWS）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250619/1012413036801298432521836.jpeg/_aBsnS7wEEf7BPqQouOJOr-YXGD7l0PVVUxp8lVMafI\"/><figcaption>電視台對橫山由加里失蹤案的報導。（YouTube@日テレNEWS）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"電視台對橫山由加里失蹤案的報導。（YouTube@日テレNEWS）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250619/1012413039154434048497612.jpeg/b-EgcgLTtcIJP3bjfHjR4Od8vsu_zROYZJZD0mSWQ9I\"/><figcaption>電視台對橫山由加里失蹤案的報導。（YouTube@日テレNEWS）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"電視台對橫山由加里失蹤案的報導。（YouTube@日テレNEWS）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250619/1012413041578872832705839.jpeg/tIPNHGdLBhbMQvvkSZ6N1ARUv3GiEIHT4Vc8d-FXPHc\"/><figcaption>電視台對橫山由加里失蹤案的報導。（YouTube@日テレNEWS）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"電視台對橫山由加里失蹤案的報導。（YouTube@TBS NEWS DIG Powered by JNN）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250619/1012413031948226560682394.jpeg/6qxH2NwP3gyxO8CzRLjWBHV5ZhdSeJFuyNBd1MjQXdQ\"/><figcaption>電視台對橫山由加里失蹤案的報導。（YouTube@TBS NEWS DIG Powered by JNN）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"電視台對橫山由加里失蹤案的報導。（YouTube@TBS NEWS DIG Powered by JNN）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250619/1012413034741764096097823.jpeg/uR8ns7ZvCOEVHDY3S3rIHRBpMCtvwhTuCAkR4ggJEeI\"/><figcaption>電視台對橫山由加里失蹤案的報導。（YouTube@TBS NEWS DIG Powered by JNN）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"電視台對橫山由加里失蹤案的報導。（YouTube@TBS NEWS DIG Powered by JNN）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250619/1012413037082316800853027.jpeg/vzlrnOyoTrwR3v8AQ12kmZRKxljGj0jOirRKQ4q0SkM\"/><figcaption>電視台對橫山由加里失蹤案的報導。（YouTube@TBS NEWS DIG Powered by JNN）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"電視台對橫山由加里失蹤案的報導。（YouTube@TBS NEWS DIG Powered by JNN）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250619/1012413039762608128726935.jpeg/shWZlw9O4jwj0OlizdnVVcXzlQMH0eB7TFUvLkxVLy4\"/><figcaption>電視台對橫山由加里失蹤案的報導。（YouTube@TBS NEWS DIG Powered by JNN）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"電視台對橫山由加里失蹤案的報導。（YouTube@TBS NEWS DIG Powered by JNN）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250619/1012413042136715264740312.jpeg/Wpq6K7nYqW-y8OqSXU8RemnLZLfqGhDhW5CNvVuQjb0\"/><figcaption>電視台對橫山由加里失蹤案的報導。（YouTube@TBS NEWS DIG Powered by JNN）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"電視台對橫山由加里失蹤案的報導。（YouTube@TBS NEWS DIG Powered by JNN）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250619/1012413027007336448253064.jpeg/uY9LlMZfr_I-Gx-8F7bXf5h1sb5UGnaWiBoYp4gaGKc\"/><figcaption>電視台對橫山由加里失蹤案的報導。（YouTube@TBS NEWS DIG Powered by JNN）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲「Japaholic」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T11:21:23.546505+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2642,"images":32,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T11:00:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T12:18:42.356391+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T11:18:32.499029+00:00","content_hash":"16f9670facec98ee8438bcd4e6612c9c948afcc521f6aac344c9e3be63a9b174","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}